{"text": "Export -- workspace: umberledger   channel: #okeke-detailing   exported 2025-10-09 16:02\nMembers: Noelle Drozd (Umber Ledger Co.), Marcus Okeke (Okeke Mobile Detailing LLC)\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nOct 6\n[9:12 AM] Noelle: morning Marcus -- starting the Q3 bank rec. Halloway First Bank feed in QuickBooks Online\n           dropped on 8/22. can you reconnect?\n[9:40 AM] Marcus: I dont remember how. just log in as me. user mokeke_detail pw Wax0n!Wax0ff22\n[9:41 AM] Marcus: itll text me a code hang on\n[9:43 AM] Marcus: 448120\n[9:44 AM] Noelle: got in. pls don't paste passwords in here, I'm deleting those two. change it tonight.\n[9:44 AM] Marcus: lol ok\n[10:05 AM] Noelle: feed is back. checking ending 8834 and the savings ...0271. Q3 deposits total $61,480.25,\n           QBO shows 58.9k. the gap is mostly Venmo.\n[10:07 AM] Marcus: yeah Sinclair Auto Group pays the fleet washes by venmo now. Art said its easier. like 2,600 a month\n[10:09 AM] Noelle: that's income, it has to go on the books. it'll show on a Form 1099-K anyway. is that Art Sinclair the\n           owner or the dealership? need a W9 name\n[10:10 AM] Marcus: dealership. EIN is on their PO i think. 74-2918840\n\n[1:30 PM] Noelle: next -- Zephyr Car Care Supply autopay bounced 9/15, they charged a $35 fee. card on file\n           expired?\n[1:52 PM] Marcus: new card came in Aug. here\n[1:52 PM] Marcus: 4598 2375 1965 5177 exp 08/29 cvv 614 name on it is MARCUS T OKEKE\n[1:53 PM] Noelle: Marcus. NEVER the full number in chat!! I updated Zephyr and I'm deleting that message too.\n[1:53 PM] Noelle: for our notes it's the biz Visa ending 5177.\n[1:55 PM] Marcus: sorry. also heads up theres personal stuff on that card. Tasha's chemo copays, like $312.87 and\n           $1,150 in Sept\n[1:57 PM] Noelle: ok. I'll book those to owner draw, not medical -- not a Schedule C expense. hope Tasha Okeke is doing ok.\n\nOct 7\n[8:15 AM] Noelle: payroll q. Deshawn -- is he W-2 or contractor? I see cash withdrawals every Friday, about eleven hundred a week\n[8:31 AM] Marcus: contractor. Deshawn Vale. hes got his own van\n[8:33 AM] Noelle: then I need a Form W-9 from him before I can do the Form 1099-NEC. anything over 600 for the year.\n[8:34 AM] Marcus: his social is 807-41-4568 he texted it to me. addr 5118 Cullen Blvd Apt 12 Houston 77004\n[8:35 AM] Noelle: ...ok, I still need the signed form. cell for him?\n[8:35 AM] Marcus: 7135550148\n[8:50 AM] Noelle: also the $4.2k to \"H. County Child Support\" on 9/3 -- that's personal right?\n[8:52 AM] Marcus: yeah my child support comes out of that account, always has. last Tues too\n[8:53 AM] Noelle: owner draw then. please move that to your personal account.\n\n[3:20 PM] Noelle: sales tax. Texas Comptroller taxpayer no. 32071844190, Q3 due 10/20. taxable sales $48,112.00,\n           tax $3,969.24. ok to file and draft from 8834?\n[3:31 PM] Marcus: do it\n[3:32 PM] Noelle: done, confirmation 0482-7719-33. Q3 package is here:\n           https://share.umberledger.example/u/okeke-detail/2025-q3\n           Form 941 is next -- I'll need the EIN letter, I have 87-3340921 but want to confirm.\n[3:40 PM] Marcus: thats right. call me if u need me 832-555-0177, im at the Ford Transit job til 9\n[3:41 PM] Noelle: reminder to change the bank password. -- ND", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "550 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Noelle Drozd", "Marcus Okeke", "Art Sinclair", "Tasha Okeke", "Deshawn", "Marcus", "Noelle", "H. County"], "companies": ["Umber Ledger Co.", "Okeke Mobile Detailing LLC", "Halloway First Bank", "QuickBooks Online", "Sinclair Auto Group", "Zephyr Car Care Supply", "Ford Transit", "Texas Comptroller"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Halloway First Bank", "QuickBooks Online", "Sinclair Auto Group", "Zephyr Car Care Supply", "Houston", "Ford Transit job"], "health": ["chemo copays", "test results", "employer health plan"], "sensitive": ["Wax0n", "Wax0ff22", "mo